{{Quote|Sakiyans are known for our reflexes. I have been raised from birth to be your superior as a fighter&hellip;|[[Djas Puhr]], to [[Boba Fett]]|<ref name="Boba Fett BWR3">[[Boba Fett — Black, White & Red 3|''Boba Fett — Black, White & Red'' 3]]</ref>}}
The '''Sakiyans''' were a [[humanoid]] [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] with bulbous, [[hair]]less heads and sharply tapered [[ear]]s.<ref name="Sakiyan" /> Sakiyans hailed from the [[Hutt Space]] planet [[Saki]], and as such were often enslaved by the [[Hutt]]s. Thanks to their keen senses and quick reflexes, Sakiyans were skilled hunters.<ref name="Sixtat" /> Sakiyan skin tones ranged from gleaming [[Color|black]]<ref name="A New Hope" /> to jade<ref name="PL" /> and plum.<ref name="The Box" />

One notable Sakiyan was [[Sixtat]], a notorious [[bounty hunter]] known as the "Outlands Butcher."<ref name="The Box" />

{{Species-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Sakiyans, albeit unidentified, first appeared in<ref name="A New Hope" /> the [[1977]]<ref name="Year by Year">''[[Star Wars Year By Year: A Visual History, Updated and Expanded Edition]]''</ref> theatrical film [[Star Wars: Episode IV A New Hope|''Star Wars'': Episode IV ''A New Hope'']].<ref name="A New Hope" /> The species was later identified as "Sakiyan" via Sixtat<ref name="Sixtat Enc">{{SWE|characters|sixtat|Sixtat}}</ref> and the [[TR-RL3 Terrapin-class bulk tanker|Turtle Tanker's]] entries in the [[Encyclopedia (StarWars.com)|Encyclopedia]] on [[StarWars.com]] simultaneously.<ref name="Turtle Tanker Enc">{{SWE|technology|turtletanker|Turtle Tanker}}</ref>

In the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity, the Sakiyans also made their debut in ''Star Wars'': Episode IV ''A New Hope''.<ref name="A New Hope" /> However, the species was first named in the [[Decipher]] collectible card game [[Star Wars Customizable Card Game|''Star Wars'' Customizable Card Game]] via the "Djas Puhr" card, available in<ref name="Djas Puhr CCG">{{CCG|set=Premiere Limited|cardname=Djas Puhr}}</ref> the [[1995]]<ref name="Premiere Limited">{{Decipher|url=starwars/whatisit/timeline.html|text=''Star Wars'' Customizable Card Game Product Timeline}}</ref> ''[[Premiere Limited]]'' set.<ref name="Djas Puhr CCG" />

